            <h2>About me</h2>
            <p>I'm Arun Pun, a .NET developer in Reading. By day I take a booking system that has survived longer than some programming languages and try to explain it to a newer one. The older one is Visual FoxPro. The newer one is C#, and it is winning, slowly.</p>
            <p>Before that I kept a vehicle-advert site from taking 40 seconds to draw a page, taught an AI to write car listings so a salesperson didn't have to, and once processed enough router orders to fund a small satellite. The Open University degree happened in the gaps.</p>
            <p>The posts here are the notes that didn't fit in a pull request: Azure, old systems, side projects, and the ideas that are still half finished.</p>
        </section>
